		{"id":"fehlschlag","type":"text","text":"## ❌ Fehlschlag\n< DC","x":-120,"y":-440,"width":200,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"krit-fehlschlag","type":"text","text":"## 💀 Krit. Fehlschlag\n≤ DC − 10\noder nat. **1**","x":100,"y":-440,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"nat","type":"text","text":"**Nat. 20** → Grad +1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; **Nat. 1** → Grad −1","x":-620,"y":-290,"width":380,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"basic-save","type":"text","text":"## Basic Save\n| Grad | Schaden |\n|---|---|\n| Krit. Erfolg | 0 |\n| Erfolg | ½ |\n| Fehlschlag | voll |\n| Krit. Fehlschlag | ×2 |","x":-620,"y":-200,"width":280,"height":270},
		{"id":"flat","type":"text","text":"## Flat Check\n| Situation | DC |\n|---|---|\n| Blutung stoppen | 15 |\n| Persist. Schaden | 15 |\n| Dying stabil. | 15 |\n| Concealment | 5 |","x":-310,"y":-200,"width":260,"height":270,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"proficiency","type":"text","text":"## Proficiency\n| Rang | Bonus |\n|---|---|\n| Untrained | +0 |\n| Trained | Lvl + 2 |\n| Expert | Lvl + 4 |\n| Master | Lvl + 6 |\n| Legendary | Lvl + 8 |","x":100,"y":-290,"width":280,"height":310,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"header-kampf","type":"text","text":"## ⚔️ Kampfablauf","x":480,"y":-600,"width":860,"height":50},
		{"id":"initiative","type":"text","text":"## Initiative\nd20 + Perception-Mod + Profizienz\nAlle gleichzeitig → höchste Zahl = erster Zug","x":480,"y":-530,"width":380,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rettungswuerfe","type":"text","text":"## Rettungswürfe\nd20 + Mod + Profizienz vs. **Zauber-DC** des Angreifers\n\n| Save | Mod | Gegen |\n|---|---|---|\n| Fortitude | CON | Gift, Erschöpfung |\n| Reflex | DEX | Flächenzauber, Fallen |\n| Will | WIS | Geisteszauber, Furcht |","x":900,"y":-530,"width":440,"height":290,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"kampfrunde","type":"text","text":"## Kampfrunde\n**3 Aktionen** + **1 Reaktion** pro Runde\n- Bewegen: 1 Aktion\n- Angreifen: 1 Aktion\n- Zaubern: 1–3 Aktionen","x":480,"y":-360,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"angriff","type":"text","text":"## Angriffswurf vs. AC\nd20 + Waffen-Mod (STR/DEX) + Profizienz(Waffe)\n\n**AC des Ziels:**\n10 + Rüstungsbonus + DEX (bis Cap) + Profizienz","x":480,"y":-120,"width":380,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"map","type":"text","text":"## MAP (Multiple Attack Penalty)\n| Angriff | Normal | Agile |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. | ±0 | ±0 |\n| 2. | −5 | −4 |\n| 3. | −10 | −8 |","x":480,"y":120,"width":380,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"zauberangriff","type":"text","text":"## Zauberangriff vs. Spell DC\n**Spell Attack:** d20 + Zauberfähigkeit-Mod + Profizienz\n**Spell DC:** 10 + Zauberfähigkeit-Mod + Profizienz\n\n→ Gegner würfelt Rettungswurf vs. Spell DC","x":900,"y":200,"width":440,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"schaden","type":"text","text":"## Schaden\n| | Formel |\n|---|---|\n| Nahkampf | Waffenwürfel + STR-Mod |\n| Fernkampf | nur Waffenwürfel |\n| Thrown | Waffenwürfel + STR-Mod |\n| **Kritischer Treffer** | **alles × 2** |","x":920,"y":-172,"width":440,"height":295,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"header-levelup","type":"text","text":"## 🆙 Stufenaufstieg","x":-620,"y":520,"width":1960,"height":50},
		{"id":"levelup-checklist","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Checkliste\n1. **Stufe +1** → 1.000 EP abziehen\n2. **Max-TP** +KON-Mod + Klassen-TP\n3. **Klassenmerkmale** aus Progressionstabelle\n4. **Talente** wählen (laut Progressionstabelle)\n5. **Zauber** ergänzen (nur Zauberwirker)\n6. **Alle Profizienzwerte +1**\n7. Stufenabhängige Boni aktualisieren","x":-620,"y":600,"width":420,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"levelup-feats","type":"text","text":"## 📅 Talent-Zeitplan\n| Stufe | Was |\n|---|---|\n| **1** | Class Feat + Ancestry Feat |\n| **Jedes gerade** | Class Feat + Skill Feat |\n| **3, 7, 11, 15, 19** | General Feat |\n| **1, 5, 9, 13, 17** | Ancestry Feat |\n\n*Fertigkeitsverbesserung: laut Klassentabelle*","x":-180,"y":600,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"levelup-auto","type":"text","text":"## ⚡ Automatisch bei jedem Level\n**Alle Profizienzwerte +1**\n(Stufe steckt in jedem Profizienzbonus)\n\n→ RK, Angriffe, Fertigkeiten,\nRettungswürfe, Klassen-SG\nsteigen alle automatisch mit!","x":360,"y":600,"width":400,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"levelup-attr","type":"text","text":"## 💪 Attributsverbesserungen\n**Stufe 5 / 10 / 15 / 20**\n4 Boosts (je verschiedenes Attribut)\n• Attribut < 18 → **+2**\n• Attribut ≥ 18 → **+1**","x":360,"y":780,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"levelup-xp","type":"text","text":"## 🏆 EP & Stufe\n**1.000 EP** = Stufenaufstieg\nMax. **Stufe 20**\n\nStufe bestimmt:\n- Profizienzbonus (+Stufe)\n- Max. Fertigkeitsrang\n- Zugang zu höherstufigen Feats & Zaubern","x":780,"y":600,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"header-skillsfeat","type":"text","text":"## 🎯 Skills & Feats – Wie funktioniert das System?","x":-620,"y":1060,"width":1960,"height":50},
		{"id":"sf-skill","type":"text","text":"## 🎯 Was ist ein Skill?\n17 Fertigkeiten, jede mit Schlüsselattribut\n\n**Mod** = Attribut-Mod + Profizienzbonus\n\nSkill wählen = **ganzer** Skill\n→ alle Aktionen sofort verfügbar\n→ keine Einzelauswahl von Aktionen\n\n**Ungeübt:** jeder kann jeden Skill (+0)\n**Trained+:** bewusst gewählt bei\nErstellung oder Stufenaufstieg","x":-620,"y":1140,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"sf-proficiency","type":"text","text":"## 📈 Trained / Expert / Master / Legendary\n**Bei Charaktererstellung:**\n- Klasse → X Skills Trained\n- Background → 1 Skill + 1 Lore Trained\n- Ancestry/Klasse → ggf. weitere\n\n**Im Spiel steigern:**\nSkill Increase (ungerade Stufen ab 3)\n→ 1 Skill 1 Rang höher\n\n| Max. Rang | ab Stufe |\n|---|---|\n| Experte | 3 |\n| Meister | 7 |\n| Legende | 15 |","x":-200,"y":1140,"width":440,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"sf-feat","type":"text","text":"## ⭐ Was ist ein Feat?\nOptionale Fähigkeit — aktiv gewählt, kostet Slot\n\n| Typ | Wann | Liste |\n|---|---|---|\n| Class Feat | jedes gerade Lvl | Klasse |\n| Skill Feat | jedes gerade Lvl | Skill-Listen |\n| General Feat | 3, 7, 11, 15, 19 | Allgemein |\n| Ancestry Feat | 1, 5, 9, 13, 17 | Volk |\n\nClass Feat ≠ Skill Feat — **separate Slots!**\nBei geradem Level: beide wählen","x":260,"y":1140,"width":460,"height":500,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"sf-link","type":"text","text":"## 🔗 Skill ↔ Skill Feat\nSkill Trained → Grundaktionen frei\nSkill Feat → optionales Upgrade dazu\n\n**Skill Feat braucht meist:**\n- Trained/Expert in dem Skill\n- Mindest-Level\n\n**Beispiel Akrobatik:**\nTrainined → Balancieren (Grundaktion, immer)\n+ Skill Feat *Steady Balance* →\nKrit. Fehlschlag zählt nur als Fehlschlag\n\n→ Skill + Skill Feat **ergänzen sich**\n→ kein Skill = kein Skill Feat darauf","x":740,"y":1140,"width":460,"height":500,"color":"4"}
	],
